图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin that auto-nudges agents to consult docs or web search when local trial-and-error becomes costly. DeepSeek Harness 插件：当本地试错成本升高时，自动注入检索提示，引导 Agent 查阅文档或联网搜索。","id":"gh:1337155407","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-research-nudge","slug":"Leitarkkk/dsh-research-nudge","topics":["ai-agent","coding-agent","cordis","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh","dsh-plugin","research","research-tool"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin that auto-nudges agents to consult docs or web search when local trial-and-e"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"rror becomes costly. DeepSeek Harness 插件：当本地试错成本升高时，自动注入检索提示，引导 Agent 查阅文档或联网搜索。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-research-nudge"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"An advisory **research-debt guard** for DeepSeek Harness. It notices when an agent spends a long str"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"etch reading, editing, executing, and repeating failures without consulting external evidence, then "},{"id":"p4s3","text":"adds a short reminder to the next model step."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"It does not call an LLM, perform a search, block a tool, or force the agent to browse. The reminder "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"explicitly allows self-contained work to continue normally."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## The problem"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Agents sometimes fall into a local trial-and-error loop:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"A search of the official docs, an exact error message, or an existing GitHub issue may resolve that "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"uncertainty faster. `dsh-research-nudge` turns the growing cost of the local loop into a determinist"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ic score called **Research Debt**."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Research Debt: a calculated example"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"This is a hypothetical sequence calculated from the documented default weights, not production telem"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"etry. It shows exactly how the score would cross the threshold:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Step | Signal | Added debt | Total |\n| --- | --- | ---: | ---: |\n| Read local code | ordinary tool"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" | +1 | 1 |\n| Edit a file | mutation | +2 | 3 |\n| Run and fail | execution + failure | +1 +4 | 8 |\n|"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" Edit again | mutation | +2 | 10 |\n| Run and hit the equivalent failure again | execution + failure "},{"id":"p12s4","text":"+ repeated failure | +1 +4 +6 | **21** |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The default threshold is 20, so the last result carries an additional model-visible context:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Equivalent failures are fingerprinted after normalizing changing numbers and addresses, so `TypeErro"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"r at line 123` and `TypeError at line 456` count as a repeat. A recognized research tool resets the "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"accumulated state for that agent."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Prerequisites:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `0.1.0-rc.7` (the current `next` release line)\n- Node.js `^22.19.0` or `>=24.0.0`"},{"id":"p18s2","text":", matching the current DSH baseline"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"From GitHub:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Git installs run this package's `prepare` build. pnpm may reject that build until you explicitly tru"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"st it. Follow the exact `allowBuilds` entry printed by DSH/pnpm, review the source first, and pin a "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"tag or commit for reproducible installs:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"After the package is published to npm, the prebuilt install is:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Verify the composed layer, then restart the profile:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Local development install"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Relative paths are resolved from the directory where `dsh plugin` is invoked."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Default policy"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Signal | Debt |\n| --- | ---: |\n| Ordinary tool call | +1 |\n| File mutation | +2 |\n| Shell/build/te"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"st execution | +1 |\n| Failed tool result | +4 |\n| Repeated equivalent failure | +6 |\n| Recognized ex"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"ternal research tool | reset to 0 |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"A reminder is eligible when any condition is met:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- Research Debt reaches 20;\n- 15 tool calls occur without recognized research; or\n- 15 minutes pass "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"without recognized research."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"After a reminder, the per-agent state continues accumulating but further reminders are suppressed fo"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"r 10 minutes. Names are normalized before classification and research matching, so `WebSearch`, `web"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"_search`, and `web-search` are treated consistently."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### Agent snooze"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"An agent that is deliberately making progress from local evidence can call the model-visible `resear"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ch_nudge_snooze` tool to suppress reminders for a while (defaults to 30 minutes, capped by `maxAgent"},{"id":"p36s3","text":" tool to suppress reminders for a while (defaults to 30 minutes, capped by `maxAgentSnoozeMinutes`):"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- Snoozing is **per agent** — other agents keep their own schedules.\n- Research Debt keeps accumulat"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"ing while snoozed: snoozing neither counts as research nor erases debt or failure counters. Once the"},{"id":"p37s3","text":" snooze expires, an already-eligible state nudges on the next tool call.\n- A failed snooze call (for"},{"id":"p37s4","text":" example, invalid arguments rejected by schema validation) arms nothing and is recorded as an ordina"},{"id":"p37s5","text":"ry failed call. Snooze executions bypass research recognition entirely, so a custom `researchTools` "},{"id":"p37s6","text":"pattern such as `search` (which substring-matches the snooze tool's own name) can never turn a faile"},{"id":"p37s7","text":"d snooze into a debt reset."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"The bundle inserts a row with the id `research-nudge`. Override that row in the profile's `cordis.pa"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"e inserts a row with the id `research-nudge`. Override that row in the profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"DSH patch layers replace a row's entire `config` value rather than deep-merging it. Any omitted fiel"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"ds above fall back to this plugin's schema defaults. `reminder` may also be set to a custom string."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"| Field | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"| `enabled` | `true` | Register the lifecycle listener |\n| `debtThreshold` | `20` | Debt score that "},{"id":"p43s2","text":"makes a reminder eligible |\n| `maxToolCallsWithoutResearch` | `15` | Call-count fallback threshold |"},{"id":"p43s3","text":"\n| `maxMinutesWithoutResearch` | `15` | Elapsed-time fallback threshold |\n| `cooldownMinutes` | `10`"},{"id":"p43s4","text":" | Minimum time between reminders |\n| `ordinaryToolDebt` | `1` | Weight for other local tools |\n| `m"},{"id":"p43s5","text":"utationDebt` | `2` | Weight for write/edit/delete-style tools |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"The adapter is compiled and tested against the official `@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools` and `@deepseek-ai/d"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"sh-llm` `0.1.0-rc.7` contracts. DSH is still a Developer Preview and explicitly allows compatibility"},{"id":"p45s3","text":"-breaking changes. If a later DSH release changes the tool waterfall or message contract, update the"},{"id":"p45s4","text":" small adapter in `src/index.ts`; the deterministic policy in `src/policy.ts` is independent."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"## Privacy and safety"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"- No telemetry, network requests, API keys, or extra model calls.\n- No tool arguments are stored or "},{"id":"p47s2","text":"copied.\n- The in-memory fingerprint uses only failed-result text; it is not persisted.\n- The reminde"},{"id":"p47s3","text":"r is advisory and never changes a tool result or permission decision.\n- Git installs execute a local"},{"id":"p47s4","text":" build script; review and pin third-party code before allowing it."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
